('115.26.b.7.E',3,'Choosing lower sodium foods can lower the risk of...','["colds", "high blood pressure", "sunburn", "growing pains"]'::jsonb,1,'Too much sodium raises blood pressure.','original'),
('115.26.b.7.E',3,'Which food is often very high in sodium?','["an apple", "plain oatmeal", "instant noodles with a flavor packet", "fresh carrots"]'::jsonb,2,'Processed foods carry lots of sodium.','original'),
