('115.26.b.12.C',3,'A danger of carrying a weapon is that it can...','["lead to injury, death or serious legal trouble", "stop all fights", "be harmless", "make you safer always"]'::jsonb,0,'Weapons increase risk.','original'),
('115.26.b.12.C',3,'If you find a gun, the safest thing to do is...','["keep it", "leave it alone and tell an adult right away", "show friends", "pick it up"]'::jsonb,1,'Do not touch, tell an adult.','original'),
