('115.26.b.23.C',3,'A sexually transmitted infection is sometimes abbreviated as...','["GPA", "STI", "BMI", "PEP"]'::jsonb,1,'STI stands for sexually transmitted infection.','original'),
('115.26.b.23.D',3,'An emotional risk of sexual activity between teens can be...','["stronger friendships always", "certain happiness", "regret, guilt or stress", "better grades"]'::jsonb,2,'Emotional consequences are real.','original'),
('115.26.b.23.D',3,'Pressure to have sex can lead to...','["more confidence", "less stress", "stable trust", "worry and loss of self-respect"]'::jsonb,3,'Pressure harms well-being.','original'),
('115.26.b.23.E',3,'Abstinence means...','["refraining from all sexual activity", "limited contact", "waiting a week", "having a partner"]'::jsonb,0,'Abstinence means no sexual activity.','original'),
('115.26.b.23.E',3,'Abstinence can be practiced...','["only in marriage", "at any time, starting now", "only adults", "only once"]'::jsonb,1,'Anyone can choose abstinence.','original'),
