('115.26.b.23.F',3,'A reason teens choose abstinence is...','["to hurt others", "to be popular", "to follow a rumor", "to focus on school and goals"]'::jsonb,3,'Choosing abstinence protects the future.','original'),
('115.26.b.23.G',3,'Abstinence is the only method that is...','["100 percent effective in preventing pregnancy and STIs", "never effective", "risky", "partly effective"]'::jsonb,0,'No other method is completely certain.','original'),
('115.26.b.23.G',3,'Compared with other methods, abstinence offers...','["the least protection", "the most complete protection", "no protection", "partial protection"]'::jsonb,1,'It is the only guaranteed method.','original'),
